      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "(My Favorite Kind of Book)"
    },
    {
      "type": "hints",
      "text": "Since I was young, I learned to like history books and novels"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "because I could read about the wisdom of many people."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "I have read about many interesting people from these"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "historical texts."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "I learned to respect many people from reading a lot of books."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "I would like to introduce to you the person I respect the most."
